薄片质量
$$
M=\iint_D\rho(x,y)dxdy=\int_0^1x^2dx\int_{x^2}^xy\,dy=\frac{1}{35}
$$
设质心坐标为 $(\bar{x},\bar{y})$，则
$$
\bar{x}=\frac{\iint_Dx\rho(x,y)dxdy}{M}
=\frac{\int_0^1x^3dx\int_{x^2}^xy\,dy}{\frac{1}{35}}
=\frac{35}{48},
$$
$$
\bar{y}=\frac{\iint_Dy\rho(x,y)dxdy}{M}
=\frac{\int_0^1x^2dx\int_{x^2}^xy^2dy}{\frac{1}{35}}
=\frac{35}{54}.
$$

